  "description": "Upgrade your towing safety with these power-heated extendable tow mirrors. Featuring a dual glass design with a power-adjustable flat mirror and convex blind spot mirror, they provide a wider field of vision. The extendable design enhances rear visibility when towing and folds in for narrow spaces. Heated mirrors defog in bad weather, while LED turn signals boost safety. Durable, easy to install, and built to last.\nFitment\n2008-2016 Ford F250 Super Duty\n2008-2016 Ford F350 Super Duty\n2008-2016 Ford F450 Super Duty\n2008-2016 Ford F550 Super Duty\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nDual Glass Design\nThese tow mirrors come with a power-adjustable upper flat mirror and a convex blind spot mirror, providing you a wider field of vision.\nExtendable Towing Mirrors for extra safety\nExtend towing mirrors give a wider rearview when towing, enhancing your driving safety. Plus, when you are in narrow places or don't these the extension, just easily fold them in.\nHeated Mirrors to Defog and Defrost\nWhen driving in foggy weather or rain or snow, the fog, frost or rain may cause the driver's sight to be unclear. However, When the mirror is heated, the heater behind the mirror quickly heats the mirror surface, slowly removing the rain or mist on the mirror surface, reducing driving risks.\nLED Turn Signal\nThese tow mirrors come with the turn signal, so when you are changing lanes, people around you can be better alerted to ensure driving safety.\nDurable Materials & Easy Installation\nThese power-heated extendable tow mirrors are made of durable plastic housing and a black finish. These tow mirrors are plug-and-play. They come with installation instructions, including wiring diagrams to help you.",
